			"notes": "## Instant Replay Mod v1.0.0\n\nInstant replay for ReplayMod on Fabric.  \nRecords packets in the background and lets you export recent gameplay instantly.\n\n### Environment\n- Minecraft: `1.21.11`\n- Fabric Loader: `0.18.2`\n- Java: `21`\n\n### Required Dependencies\n- Fabric API\n- ReplayMod (`1.21.11-2.6.25`)\n\n### Features\n- Background silent recording\n- Ring buffer for recent replay data\n- Press `F8` to export replay (`.mcpr`)\n- Press `F7` or use pause menu button to open settings\n- Configurable replay length in settings\n- Export cooldown to prevent accidental double export\n\n### Notes\n- Replay files are saved to ReplayMod recording folder.\n- If packet load is very high, oversized packets may be dropped (visible in logs)."
		}
